<FeatureFacts id="splits" />

A split is your plan: training days (Push, Pull, Legs, or Monday, Wednesday, Friday), each with its
exercises and sets. One split is **active**; Quick Start trains from it.

## On the phone

Open Splits, then New. Add days, then open a day to add exercises. Set it active from the split's page.
